@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 144
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

title 命令交换与执行结果回流

participant "CLI Parser" as Parser
participant "CLI Session" as Session
participant "Core CommandExecutor" as Executor
participant "Core CommandReceiver" as Receiver
participant "Document / History / SVG IO" as Domain
participant "Terminal" as Terminal

Parser -> Session : CommandParseResult（含 Command）
Session -> Executor : Command
Executor -> Receiver : command.execute(receiver)
Receiver -> Domain : 执行、读取或写入
Domain --> Receiver : 新状态、数据或 ProtocolError
Receiver --> Executor : CommandResult 或 ProtocolError
Executor -> Executor : 转换错误、记录可撤销命令
Executor --> Session : CommandResult
Session -> Terminal : 输出成功消息或 error 消息

note over Parser, Receiver
  Protocol 定义本次交换使用的
  Command、Shape、CommandResult、ProtocolError 和端口契约
end note

@enduml
